<item>
<title>反驳中国AI主力造短剧 AI业者：数据不靠谱官媒：AI发展从未跑偏中国人工智能（AI）是否主要用于生成短剧，再惹争议。字</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10371</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10371</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 09:54:04 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>反驳中国AI主力造短剧 AI业者：数据不靠谱官媒：AI发展从未跑偏</b><br/><br/>中国人工智能（AI）是否主要用于生成短剧，再惹争议。字节跳动旗下AI助手“豆包”公关负责人，以及中国官媒近日先后发声反驳。<br/><br/>“豆包”公关负责人刘星和官媒针对有中国企业披露数据指，中国人工智能词元（Token）消耗55%用于短剧及视频生成，软件开发仅占15%，以及有自媒体对比中美数据，声称美国约58%的Token用于代码生成及企业自动化的说法作出回应。刘星质疑数据“不靠谱”，官媒强调，中国AI发展没有跑偏，无需崇洋媚外、妄自菲薄。<br/><br/>但台媒引述另一名中国AI业者称，据其了解，中国确实有超过50%的Token用于视频生成。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80">#科技</a> <a href="?q=%23AI">#AI</a> <a href="?q=%23%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A">#企业</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%83%AD%E6%90%9C">#热搜</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/><br/>《中央社》<a href="https://www.cna.com.tw/news/acn/202610200105.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">报告：中国AI算力55%用在制作短剧及影音</a><br/>《星岛头条》<a href="https://www.stheadline.com/zh-hans/realtime-china/3627694/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">豆包反驳过半AI算力制爽剧 指母企仅用1成Token造片</a><br/>《人民日报》<a href="https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_34286985" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">人民锐评：把“火药”做成“烟花”？警惕“中国AI跑偏论”</a><br/>《联合报》<a href="https://udn.com/news/story/7333/9824560" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">陆国内超半数算力造「爽剧」引热议陆业者：确实超50%用在图像生成</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/Nf0QXyWDVI7yMpj9tPlRhLZXxhHKEJ5v2vjqYuO4Ax5_wgbJPXWd-5OYGFoS-jZpBPk0tS1tI6WWrEh97H1sAYzLU_IlYySK3bDTR_gCin2D-zJiNk0oswvk9hjs3A4p6NJzCQbET1PHSiepO0UmsxX9IXLUVzbB28ndoQbTL0wXktGzcXpJp8BKSV7eZkR9P4LVEwdfD78QI6Fb5tuzdWIwDb8RqkipGHQKoTtMLNO6kbvAfKf4FvHquN-dTRL8TrO4-3SuvsgC2aN4-OzA5P2Uk_j7VtfMDNNrSHt2uIZjy-LWxnVObhApEotxLLCwjjnjJ07DbRh8xkL9ph69cQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/JtCANJgLl70d6QtGTnSFCZ5PkRX3_c3h7-H4S3FRI54HpDjA62lXsh7qrNdbq_64AGXcbFlrwZ_QxcmOB2xT7hxr_H9gQplRd3fGXEgwUtKyTlZfMdwyGpb0aVuD1hFQMeEiHTO8VNlNlXQCcNyPvKnKw_FFYBfA9w3CjmCclHl2OQId-i95yB_0Rg9e8NhzhwcwHi3_qbeE-5Oj9pkmKcueVhi29uw__gRAeT_sv650WsO8rBbcxGhxNbsHZDOfEoydRRFZappBcra5rPS-S20OTMRMRccI0NSpzZoWQZHY4dJ7ZUWs9PNk7f5zb6ko9IpVMWzVtxL0XL0ecTNHLw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/OELYtFaY02ycQOVye892vWazjhEetveDIEprxIfLPY2OYNlqJeqLtNaXPJhuVrM7BE1GOJlGJh1VLbEH-3apkqK4ZR5SDwmzfC8ymnDw2ghqxu8OShV3V7tbtk7xz11YtJSwkObctCWzoJbkiwhBeFzmJvkVq4Lb99r7Bd9MPZ5ixS95mRHVADw7a6ADNbalgseRPOhZUHosfmsL6nK57B0nfydvSitl-Vzo5gx9wLxG4XZy-c-1S5CV1FKRo6uDOkOt1lIrE3TboN1PAM75lqHbnXwQDZfsK2iyIN6r9Vk6T4qzLx199WPmT24AQqMuKy01t-aKNWkCdsIFUe8auA.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/faFyR62fSnku-9y3M_B3VEiNk7kl0_cDifxpuD6CpkTwpqXMC0OXVu94xdjIiAv_Cy3NRgfLJwlvoHH83dAfPvEyzZSVe3SW5q_F1IpMKophgQrXmCx3F2nEt2tk3yPahBOJheM9Zoy3dnIID8SyGjb-LHA2gpxrzd_6ZLyKuwiLahl5wCzfUjdxk0OxkKe15grnW0NZyejsmk48v2E8bceEsGqQiEs3aUhxryePEA_lRe_nx-lDwaylFppBBoTeOGF1vvHyg4EeTiqK730D6Dq0tZOrDUHD-A_WOdorbfg-VB8rcjH5FqCoEegU7leW_2i8v7dXR9OfLh_XyB-yOw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9881.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4B7.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p>]]></description>
